# Invisible Woman, Sue Storm: lifelink, and "Whenever you put one or more +1/+1 counters on one or more other Heroes you control, you
# may create a 0/4 colorless Wall creature token with defender." Counters come from Take Up the Shield, and nothing is on the stack
# after a spell resolves when the ability has not triggered.
#   Turn 4: Bot2's Take Up the Shield puts a counter on Bot1's Masked Meower (a Hero): Bot2 puts it, not Bot1, so no trigger.
#   Turn 5: Bot1's puts one on that Meower and it accepts: a Wall Token, a 0/4 colorless defender.
#   Turn 7: one on Invisible Woman herself - not "other" - no trigger.   Turn 9: one on Bot1's Ornithopter - not a Hero - no trigger.
#   Turn 11: one on Bot2's own Masked Meower - a Hero, but not one Bot1 controls - no trigger.
#   Turn 13: one on the Meower again: it triggers, and Bot1 declines: no second Wall.

